  "summary": "I am a Junior Software Developer with a background in Computer Science and Mathematics, currently working in a professional software development environment. I recently graduated in December 2025 and bring a strong foundation in programming, problem-solving, and analytical thinking.\n\nI have hands-on experience developing and maintaining software applications using Java and C++, working with APIs, databases, and version control systems in a structured, security-conscious setting. I collaborate with cross-functional teams to implement features, resolve issues, and support system functionality while adhering to established development and compliance standards.\n\nPrior to transitioning into software development, I worked for over six years in a fast-paced customer-faced role, which strengthened my communication skills, reliability, and ability to perform under pressure. These are skills in which I carry into work as a developer.\n\nI am motivated to continue growing as a software engineer, contributing to impactful projects, and expanding my technical expertise within secure and scalable systems.",
