      "description": "During my internship so far, I contributed to both front-end and back-end development tasks, gaining hands-on experience as a full-stack developer. I worked extensively with Angular to build a new website and enhance an existing one, implementing features such as user login and management. This involved integrating API endpoints and interacting with the database to support user authentication. I transitioned the server from HTTP to HTTPS using certificates and signing keys, and implemented JWT-based user authorization with token expiration to enforce session timeouts. Additionally, I was introduced to Android app development using Android Studio and Gradle, where I helped design and build onto one of their existing apps, contributed to backend logic, and worked with PostgreSQL to run queries and debug issues. I also explored biometric systems, learning how technologies like facial and fingerprint recognition are used for identity verification within secure systems.",
